# Both images build from the repository root, so this list decides how much of
# the working tree is shipped to the daemon. Keeping it tight matters here: the
# camera clips alone are ~46 MB and node_modules dwarfs the source.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/.github

# Local environment. The deployed values come from the root .env via
# docker-compose, never from a file baked into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Runtime output, not input. The engine recreates this on first violation.
backend/data/speedViolations.json

# Editors, OS noise, logs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*

# Docs and scratch work are not needed to build or run either service.
*.md
!README.md
scratch/
